  "published": "2026-09-28T03:23:34.157Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 introduces LlamaCppServer: inventory with separate installation/load states, health and mode/capability discovery, router lifecycle and SSE-observed downloads, and label-preserving metrics. Caller-owned HTTP, request-local authentication and sanitized failures are included. Live checks used llama.cpp b11146 in router and single-model modes with a small Qwen GGUF model; see full notes for coverage and limits. Cancellation stops local waiting without promising remote rollback. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.LlamaCpp/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v100",
